{"id":"202832","name":"泡菜","author":"CorrineNora","authorId":"7331285","desc":"","cover":"https://i3.meishichina.com/atta/recipe/2014/12/20/20141220000037969.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p800","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"600克"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"300克"},{"name":"梨","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒","amount":"100克"},{"name":"辣椒酱","amount":"150克"},{"name":"虾酱","amount":"30克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾酱少放一点，也可以放鱼露，但是鱼露稍贵一点","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_2014122000003921.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"这个酱比较辣但是放多一点也没大问题","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000043894.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"梨子同上，梨子在拌的过程就出汁碎了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000047118.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"大白菜是腌了24小时，腌的时间跟你的盐水咸度有关，一颗白菜200克盐左右，水的话以漫过白菜为主。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000053136.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"配菜都放一块","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000059424.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"我自己加了芝麻，是想会不会更好吃一些","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000102177.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"加一点糖就是提下梨子没有的甜味","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000105991.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"辣椒末找那种不是很辣的","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000108121.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"这个酱比较辣但是放多一点也没大问题","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000110577.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"虾酱少放一点，也可以放鱼露，但是鱼露稍贵一点","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000114505.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"开始搅拌，搅拌的时候可以用力抓一下","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000116208.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"这样就可以了","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000119295.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"均匀地抹在白菜上，然后在白菜根部多放一些搅拌的配菜","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2014/12/20/p800_20141220000123824.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"拧盖子的时候加一层保鲜膜，不容易跑味，不会进空气，把它放在冰箱里，大概3-4度就可以了。可以放一个月甚至更长。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}